        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c5f92901-871d-5570-bec7-7a31abf0f64e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Illinois\n- Organizations: United States House of Representatives, Congressional NextGen 9-1-1 Caucus\n- People: John Shimkus, Anna Eshoo\n- Roles: U.S. Representative, Congressman, Congresswoman\n- Concepts: Illinois's 20th congressional district, Illinois's 19th congressional district, Illinois's 15th congressional district, 2000 Census\n\nFacts:\n- Illinois's 20th congressional district was a congressional district for the United States House of Representatives in Illinois.\n- Illinois's 20th congressional district was eliminated as a result of the 2000 Census.\n- John Shimkus was the last representative of Illinois's 20th congressional district and was redistricted into Illinois's 19th congressional district.\n- John Shimkus was born on February 21, 1958.\n- John Shimkus has served as the U.S. Representative for Illinois's 15th congressional district since 1997.\n- The Congressional NextGen 9-1-1 Caucus is headed by Congressman John Shimkus of Illinois and Congresswoman Anna Eshoo of California.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
